IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg4-s217-fiduciary-voting`

-- Tests of dg4-s217-fiduciary-voting.l4. Expected values are written by hand from the text of s 217
-- (de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, lines 820-826), beside each assertion, never copied from the module's own output.

§ `Tests of s 217`

§§ `(a): fiduciaries and pledgors`

#ASSERT `s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` `as a person holding the stock in a fiduciary capacity` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` `as a person whose stock is pledged` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` `as a person whose stock is pledged` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` `as the pledgee of the stock, or the pledgee's proxy` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` `as the pledgee of the stock, or the pledgee's proxy` FALSE)

§§ `(b): shares in the names of two or more persons`

-- arguments: notice-to-the-contrary, unequal interests, persons voting, persons one way, persons the other way, interest one way, interest the other way
-- (1) only 1 votes: that person's act binds all
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE FALSE 1 1 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST `the act of the only person who votes binds all`
-- (2) more than 1 vote: the act of the majority so voting binds all (2 of 3 persons)
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE FALSE 3 2 1 0 0 EQUALS JUST `the act of the majority so voting binds all`
-- (3) evenly split (1 against 1)
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE FALSE 2 1 1 0 0 EQUALS JUST `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
-- unequal interests: 2 persons voting one way hold 40% between them, the 1 person the other way holds 60%: the majority in interest is the one person
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE TRUE 3 2 1 40 60 EQUALS JUST `the act of the majority so voting binds all`
-- unequal interests: 2 against 2 persons by count, but 50 and 50 in interest is an even split in interest
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE TRUE 2 1 1 50 50 EQUALS JUST `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
-- unequal interests: persons divided 1 and 1 (evenly by count) but 70 and 30 in interest: the majority in interest carries
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE TRUE 2 1 1 70 30 EQUALS JUST `the act of the majority so voting binds all`
-- equal interests: the count governs, the interests are ignored
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE FALSE 2 1 1 70 30 EQUALS JUST `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
-- written notice to the contrary and the instrument or order furnished: the instrument governs instead
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` TRUE FALSE 3 2 1 0 0 EQUALS JUST `the written notice to the contrary and the instrument or order it is furnished with govern instead`
-- nobody votes: the text is not covered
#ASSERT `s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b)(3)
#ASSERT `s 217(b)(3) the person may apply to the Court of Chancery or another court with jurisdiction to appoint an additional person` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 217(b)(3) the person may apply to the Court of Chancery or another court with jurisdiction to appoint an additional person` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 217(b)(3) the person may apply to the Court of Chancery or another court with jurisdiction to appoint an additional person` TRUE FALSE)
-- the shares are then voted as determined by a majority of the persons voting and the person appointed: 3 persons, 2 in favour
#ASSERT `s 217(b)(3) the shares are voted in favor as determined by a majority of the persons so voting and the person appointed` 3 2 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 217(b)(3) the shares are voted in favor as determined by a majority of the persons so voting and the person appointed` 3 1 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 217(b)(3) the shares are voted in favor as determined by a majority of the persons so voting and the person appointed` 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
